                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course is a step-by-step learning program focused on medical communication skills and clinical scenario response, designed to cultivate clinical students' communication abilities and humanistic qualities. By studying advanced communication techniques and scenario simulation courses, it aims to enhance their capacity to handle various situations that may arise in professional practice, strengthen the integration of medical humanities education in communication, and foster a new era of medical professionalism. The course seeks to establish exemplary medical ethics and conduct, nurturing outstanding physicians who possess both humanistic compassion and effective communication skills.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
